<hr />
<h3 id="tools-deprecated">Tools (deprecated)</h3>
<p><code>tools</code> is <strong>deprecated</strong>. Prefer the agent's <a href="#permissions"><code>permission</code></a> field for new configs, updates and more fine-grained control.</p>
<p>Allows you to control which tools are available in this agent. You can enable or disable specific tools by setting them to <code>true</code> or <code>false</code>. In an agent's <code>tools</code> config, <code>true</code> is equivalent to <code>{"*": "allow"}</code> permission and <code>false</code> is equivalent to <code>{"*": "deny"}</code> permission.</p>
<pre><code class="language-json">{
